.Sh HISTORY
The provider CIPHER interface was introduced in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
The
.Fn OSSL_FUNC_cipher_encrypt_skey_init
and
.Xr OSSL_FUNC_cipher_decrypt_skey_init 3
were introduced in OpenSSL 3.5.
